    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom mid-terrace family home to the market, ideally situated in the ever-popular Castlecurragh Vale development, Mulhuddart, Dublin 15.\nCastlecurragh Vale is a mature and peaceful residential development ideally located close to a wealth of local amenities including schools, shops, cafés and recreational facilities. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is just minutes away, while commuters are exceptionally well catered for with excellent public transport links and easy access to the M50 and N3 road networks, making travel throughout Dublin and beyond both quick and convenient.\nBright and well-proportioned internal living accommodation extending to approximately c. 89 sq.m briefly comprises an entrance hallway, a spacious living room, a fully fitted kitchen/dining area and guest WC to the ground floor. Upstairs hosts three well-appointed bedrooms, including a generous master bedroom, together with a modern family bathroom. Externally, the property benefits from a well-sized private rear garden, providing the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining and relaxation.\nNo. 119 comes to the market in good condition throughout and boasts a host of additional features including a C BER rating, gas fired central heating and the added benefit of no rental cap, making it an excellent opportunity for both owner-occupiers and investors alike. Offered to the market with no onward chain, this fantastic home is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, growing families and investors seeking a property in one of Dublin 15's most convenient and well-connected locations.\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n• BER C Rated\n• C. 89 sq.m\n• Three bed / two bath family home\n• Mid-terrace property\n• Gas fired central heating\n• No rental cap\n• No onward chain\n• Excellent opportunity for investors\n• Quiet and well-established development\n• Bright and spacious living accommodation\n• Well-sized private rear garden\n• Close to schools, shops and local amenities\n• Blanchardstown Shopping Centre within minutes\n• Excellent public transport links\n• Easy access to the M50 & N3 road networks\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, growing families and investors\n• Early viewing strongly advised"
      },
      {
